# Claude Code runtime state lives in the real ~/.claude directory, outside this
# repo - see "Claude Configuration" in the root CLAUDE.md. Only the folded
# directory symlinks (agents/, rules/, skills/, themes/, scheduled-tasks/) can
# still receive writes from Claude Code or skill installers, so this list only
# needs to cover those. If a new runtime path shows up in git status here, the
# migration has been undone rather than a rule being missing.
.claude/skills/.search-log.jsonl
.claude/skills/synced
.claude/skills/vault-query
.claude/skills/systems-memory-check
